&lt;p&gt;Lifecycle separates progress, waits, retries, and terminal outcomes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/docs/assets/archify-lifecycle.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Lifecycle example&#34;
	
	
